    <!-- About Activity Content -->
    <string name="about_title">🌿 SmartLeaf - AI-Powered Crop Disease Detection</string>
    <string name="about_intro">SmartLeaf is a free mobile application specially designed for farmers and gardeners. It helps you identify crop diseases by simply taking a picture of the leaf. Using advanced AI technology, the app analyzes the photo and provides easy-to-follow advice in your preferred language.</string>

    <string name="about_vision_title">🌟 Our Vision</string>
    <string name="about_vision_text">To make farming easier and smarter by giving every farmer a powerful tool to keep crops healthy and safe. We envision a future where technology empowers farmers to protect their livelihood and increase agricultural productivity.</string>

    <string name="about_mission_title">🎯 Our Mission</string>
    <string name="about_mission_text">• Help farmers quickly detect diseases in their crops at early stages\n• Provide solutions in multiple languages for better accessibility\n• Protect crops from damage and increase overall yield\n• Bring modern AI technology to rural areas in a simple, user-friendly way\n• Make crop health monitoring accessible to everyone, everywhere</string>

    <string name="about_goals_title">🎯 Our Goals</string>
    <string name="about_goals_text">• Enable farmers to check crop health using just their smartphone camera\n• Deliver highly accurate results with 90%+ accuracy rate\n• Offer clear, actionable steps to treat and prevent crop diseases\n• Support farmers in multiple regional languages\n• Continuously improve detection algorithms through machine learning</string>

    <string name="about_features_title">✅ What SmartLeaf Can Do</string>
    <string name="about_features_text">• Detect crop diseases by capturing a leaf photo instantly\n• Provide detailed disease information and prevention tips\n• Suggest remedies that are simple, affordable, and effective\n• Offer multilingual support for farmers across regions\n• Completely free and easy to use for all farmers\n• Work offline after initial model download\n• Save scan history for future reference</string>

    <string name="about_why_title">📖 Why We Built SmartLeaf</string>
    <string name="about_why_text">Many farmers lose their crops every year because they cannot identify diseases early enough. Traditional methods require expert consultation, which is often expensive and time-consuming. SmartLeaf was built to make disease detection quick, accurate, and accessible. With just a smartphone, farmers can take a photo and get instant, reliable results.</string>

    <string name="about_helps_title">🔹 How It Helps Farmers</string>
    <string name="about_helps_text">• Saves crops by detecting diseases at an early, treatable stage\n• Works even in rural areas with basic smartphones\n• Supports local languages for ease of use and understanding\n• Helps farmers grow healthy crops and improve their income\n• Reduces dependency on expensive agricultural consultants\n• Provides 24/7 access to crop health monitoring\n• Empowers farmers with knowledge and actionable insights</string>

    <string name="about_commitment_title">🌱 Our Commitment</string>
    <string name="about_commitment_text">SmartLeaf is committed to continuous improvement and farmer satisfaction. We regularly update our disease detection models, add support for more crops and languages, and incorporate user feedback to make the app even better.</string>

    <string name="about_community_title">💚 Join Our Community</string>
    <string name="about_community_text">Be part of the SmartLeaf family and help us make farming smarter and more sustainable. Your feedback and suggestions help us improve and serve you better.</string>


